    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshitabu eshikanye shiasambwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwakhane kwaYehoyakimu waYosia, omuruchi waYuda, likhuwa lino lieetsela Yeremia okhurula khuMWAMI; mbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukula eshitabu eshikanye, ohandiichemwo amakhuwa kosi aka ndakhusunjila akokhufukula Isiraeli, nakokhufukula Yuda, nakokhurukula amahanga kosi, okhurula khunyanga olwa ndakhusunjila, okhurula khundaalo tsiaYosia, okhuula olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haundi kakhaba mbu abeinzu yaYuda balahulila akamabii kosi nka ereelekhwo omwoyo okhubakholela; mbu bakalushe buli mundu okhurula khunjilaye imbii, nasi nimbaleshela obumayaanu bwabwe nobwonooni bwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yeremia nalanga Barukhu waNeria; naye Barukhu nahnndiika nmakhuwa kosi akarula mumunwa kwaYeremia, mbu amakhuwa kosi aka OMWAMI yali niyamusunjila, mushitabu eshikanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia namulaka Barukhu ari Isie ndeekalilwa; shinyala okhutsia munzu yOMWAMI ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho iwe otsie, osoome amakhuwa kOMWAMI akomushitabu eshikanye eshia ohandiichilemwo akarula mumunwa kwanje, mumarwi kabandu, munzu yOMWAMI khunyanga eyokhuhonjelakhwo inzala, khandi okasoome mumarwi kabaYuda bosi abarulanga mumataala kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haundi balaleera amasaayo kabwe imbeli w, nibakalukha buli mundu okhurula khunjilaye imbii; okhuba oburima nobululu obwa OMWAMI yarumbuule khubandu bano nobunji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Barukhu waNeria yakhola ako kosi aka Yeremia omunabii yamulaka, nasooma mushitabu tsana amakhuwa kOMWAMI munzu yOMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumuyika kwakharaano kwaYehoyakimu waYosia, omuruchi waYuda, mumwesi kwashienda, abandu bosi abali muYerusalemu, nabandu bosi abarula mumataala kaYuda nibeetsa eYerusalemu, bakhupa omulome kweinyanga yokhuhonga inzala imbeli wOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Barukhu nasooma mushitabu tsana amakhuwa kaYeremia, munzu YOMWAMI, mushisika shiaGemaria waShafani omuhandiichi, mulwanyi Iwemukulu, habwinjililo bwEshilibwa Eshiyia shieinzu yOMWAMI, mumarwi kabandu bosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Mikaya waGemaria waShafani yali nahuliile mushitabu tsana amakhuwa kosi kOMWAMI, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yakholomokha natsia enanzu yomuruchi, mushisika shiomuhandiichi; ne mbabo, abakhulundu bosi bali nibeekhaaleyo, mbu Elishama omuhandiichi, naDelaya waShemaya, naElinatsani waAkhibori, naGemaria waShafani, naZedekia waHanania, nende abakhulundu bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mikaya nabarumbulila amakhuwa kosi aka yali nahuliile olwa Barukhu yali nasoomeele eshitabu mumarwi kabandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abakhulundu bosi nibaruma Yehudi waNetsania waShelemia waKushi khuBarukhu; bari Bukula mumukhonokwo eshitabu eshikanye shieneshio eshia osoomelenje mumarwi kabandu, witse. Kho Barukhu waNeria nabukula eshitabu eshikanye tsana mumukhono, natsia ewa bali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibamusunjila mbu Bulaano yikhala, okasoome khuhulile. Kho Barukhu nakasooma, nibahulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibahuliile amakhuwa ako kosi, baria, nibashiukhana nibahengana, nibasunjila Barukhu mbu Khatimba khumuboolele omuruchi ako kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamureeba Barukhu bari Khuboolele bulaano, wahandiichile orie amakhuwa ako kosi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barukhu nabakalusia mbu Yeremia yarumbulila amakhuwa ako kosi nomunwa, nasi ningahandiika nobwino mushitabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abakhulundu nibamusunjila Barukhu mbu Tsia wibise, iwe nende Yeremia yesi; omundu yesi aramanya ewa muli ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nibeenjila mulwanyi, ewomuruchi; ne bali nibabiishile eshitabu eshikanye tsana mushisika shiaElishama omuhandiichi; nibaboolela omuruchi amakhuwa ako kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omuruchi yaruma Yehudi okhwenda eshitabu eshikanye tsana; naye nashirusia mushisika shiaElishama omuhandiichi; Yehudi nashisoomela omuruchi nabakhulundu bosi abali nibasinjiile ahambi nomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kwali omwesi kwashienda; naye omuruchi yali niyeekhaale munzu eyetsindaalo tsiomunyiri; ne omulilo kwali nikwakha mwichiiko imbeliwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne buli olwa Yehudi yali nasoomile tsimbapulo tsitaru tsine, omuruchi yakhalakanga nolwembe, nasukuna mumulilo okwomwichiiko, okhuula olwa eshitabu shiosi shiali nishihweeleele mumulilo okwali mwichiiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shibariakhwo ta, kata okhurandula ebiifwalo biabwe, omuruchi mwene kata abasumbabe bosi abahulila ako kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Elinatsani naDelaya naGemaria bali nibamukayile omuruchi mbu aleshe okhusamba eshitabu tsana; ne yakhaya okhuhulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi nalaka Yerameeli omwana womuruchi naSeraya waAzirieli naShelamia waAbudeeli okhuhamba Barukhu omuhandiichi naYeremia omunabii; habula OMWAMI yababisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana likhuwa liOMWAMI nilimwitsila Yeremia olwa omuruchi yali nasambile eshitabu eshikanye tsana shiamakhuwa aka Barukhu yahandiika akarula mumunwa kwaYeremia; liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukula khandi eshitabu eshikanye shindi, ohandiichemwo amakhuwa kalia kosi, akabeele nikali mushitabu eshiambeli, eshia Yehoyakimu omuruchi waYuda asambile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumakhuwa kaYehoyakimu omuruchi waYuda, oboole mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Osambile eshitabu eshikanye shino, nosunga ori Olwashiina nohandiichilemwo mbu Omuruchi waBabeli shialachweya okhwitsa okhumulula eshialo shino, nokhwakamiamwo abandu nemiruko biombi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola khukaYehoyakimu omuruchi waYuda; mbu Shialabakhwo nomundu okhwikhala khushifumbi shiaDaudi ta; nakwo omulambokwe kulasukunwa elwanyi okhuliibwa nomubasu kweshiteere neisakitu yomushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalamukuuma ye nabetsinzibulotsie nende abasumbabe khulwa obumayaanu bwabwe; ndalaleera khubo, nokhubamenyanga muYerusalemu, nokhubaYuda, obubii obwo bwosi obwa ndabarumbulila, ne nibarahulila ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
